   "_id": 12530,
   "ANSWER": "<ol data-end=\"2708\" data-start=\"2499\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1491\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3001\" data-start=\"2744\">LRU closely mimics real-time usage, leading to fewer page faults. However, it requires <strong data-end=\"2883\" data-start=\"2847\">tracking the time of last access</strong> or <strong data-end=\"2915\" data-start=\"2887\">updating data structures</strong>, which makes it harder to implement compared to FIFO, which just uses a simple queue.</p>\n\n\t<p data-end=\"3028\" data-start=\"3003\">&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"3026\" data-start=\"3006\">Mark Allocation:</strong></p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ul data-end=\"2857\" data-start=\"2736\">\n\t<li data-end=\"3054\" data-start=\"3029\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3054\" data-start=\"3031\">Accuracy of LRU &ndash; 30%</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3094\" data-start=\"3055\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3094\" data-start=\"3057\">Difficulty in tracking access &ndash; 40%</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3141\" data-start=\"3095\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3141\" data-start=\"3097\">Comparison to FIFO &ndash; 30%</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 4,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"2065\" data-start=\"1993\">Why is LRU more accurate but harder to implement than FIFO in labs?</h3>\n",
